<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. Pattern reference: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/481d523374745e77d0cf9c53a4115ab5dd7c8481/apps/v4/examples/base/alert-dialog-destructive.tsx -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="alert-dialog" data-kv-variant="discard" data-klic-component="alert-dialog" class="kn-alert-dialog"><header data-part="heading"><strong>저장하지 않은 변경 3건</strong></header><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="open" data-kv-target="kv-export-alert-dialog-alert-dialog-discard-dialog" data-part="btn">편집 취소</button><dialog role="alertdialog" id="kv-export-alert-dialog-alert-dialog-discard-dialog" aria-label="변경 사항을 버릴까요?" data-klic-surface="overlay" data-part="dialog"><header data-part="heading"><strong>변경 사항을 버릴까요?</strong></header><p data-part="muted">저장하지 않은 제목과 설명의 변경이 사라집니다. 계속 편집하려면 닫기를 선택하세요.</p><div class="ku-actions" data-part="actions"><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="dialog-confirm"  data-part="btn">변경 사항 폐기</button></div><footer class="ku-actions" data-part="actions"><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="close"  data-part="btn">닫기</button></footer></dialog></div>
